{
  "branches": [
    "main"
  ],
  "plugins": [
    [
      "@semantic-release/commit-analyzer",
      {
        "preset": "conventionalcommits",
        "releaseRules": [
          {
            "breaking": true,
            "release": "major"
          },
          {
            "type": "feat",
            "release": "minor"
          },
          {
            "type": "fix",
            "release": "patch"
          },
          {
            "revert": true,
            "release": "patch"
          },
          {
            "type": "perf",
            "release": "patch"
          },
          {
            "type": "chore",
            "scope": "deps",
            "release": "patch"
          },
          {
            "type": "chore",
            "scope": "security",
            "release": "patch"
          }
        ],
        "parserOpts": {
          "noteKeywords": [
            "BREAKING CHANGE",
            "BREAKING CHANGES"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    [
      "@semantic-release/release-notes-generator",
      {
        "preset": "conventionalcommits",
        "presetConfig": {
          "types": [
            {
              "type": "feat",
              "section": "Features"
            },
            {
              "type": "fix",
              "section": "Bug Fixes"
            },
            {
              "type": "perf",
              "section": "Performance Improvements"
            },
            {
              "type": "chore",
              "section": "Maintenance"
            },
            {
              "type": "docs",
              "section": "Documentation",
              "hidden": true
            },
            {
              "type": "style",
              "section": "Code Style",
              "hidden": true
            },
            {
              "type": "refactor",
              "section": "Code Refactoring",
              "hidden": true
            },
            {
              "type": "build",
              "section": "Build System",
              "hidden": true
            },
            {
              "type": "ci",
              "section": "CI/CD",
              "hidden": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "writerOpts": {
          "footerPartial": "{{#if @root.IMAGE_REGISTRY}}\n\n---\n\n## Container Images\n\n**Registry:** `{{@root.IMAGE_REGISTRY}}`\n**Repository:** `{{@root.IMAGE_NAME}}`\n**Version:** `{{@root.IMAGE_VERSION}}`\n\n### Pull Command\n\n```bash\ndocker pull {{@root.IMAGE_REGISTRY}}/{{@root.IMAGE_NAME}}:{{@root.IMAGE_VERSION}}\n```\n\n### View in Registry\n\n- [View on GitHub Container Registry](https://{{@root.IMAGE_REGISTRY}}/{{@root.IMAGE_NAME}})\n\n<{{#if @root.IMAGE_DIGEST}}\n### Image Digest\n\nFor enhanced security and reproducibility, you can pull by digest:\n\n```bash\ndocker pull {{@root.IMAGE_REGISTRY}}/{{@root.IMAGE_NAME}}@{{@root.IMAGE_DIGEST}}\n```\n{{/if}}\n{{/if}}"
        }
      }
    ],
    "@semantic-release/git",
    [
      "@semantic-release/github",
      {
        "assets": [
          "dist/**"
        ]
      }
    ]
  ]
}